INSERT INTO problems (slug,leetcode_id,title,description,difficulty,source_url,topics,companies,company_count,popularity,acceptance,recency,description_source,embedding) VALUES ('game-play-analysis-i',511,'Game Play Analysis I','Table: Activity

+--------------+---------+
| Column Name | Type |
+--------------+---------+
| player_id | int |
| device_id | int |
| event_date | date |
| games_played | int |
+--------------+---------+
(player_id, event_date) is the primary key (combination of columns with unique values) of this table.
This table shows the activity of players of some games.
Each row is a record of a player who logged in and played a number of games (possibly 0) before logging out on someday using some device.

Write a solution to find the first login date for each player.

Return the result table in any order .

The result format is in the following example.

Example 1:

Input:
Activity table:
+-----------+-----------+------------+--------------+
| player_id | device_id | event_date | games_played |
+-----------+-----------+------------+--------------+
| 1 | 2 | 2016-03-01 | 5 |
| 1 | 2 | 2016-05-02 | 6 |
| 2 | 3 | 2017-06-25 | 1 |
| 3 | 1 | 2016-03-02 | 0 |
| 3 | 4 | 2018-07-03 | 5 |
+-----------+-----------+------------+--------------+
Output:
+-----------+-------------+
| player_id | first_login |
+-----------+-------------+
| 1 | 2016-03-01 |
| 2 | 2017-06-25 |
